-- Source module: Solutions.KFNTop
/-!
# KFN: `tens Cm` on any number of bits at power-of-two strides

**`cLow`**: for `D'` bits at strides `2^{pos i} S₀` (`pos` injective, `< t`) on `B · 2^t · S₀`
records with `W^k ∣ B` and `D' < m^{k+1}`, the digit pieces (`pcs m k 0 D'`), each a node of
level `≤ k` (`lv_all`), implement `tens Cm`; at most `(k+1) m` pieces, so scale
